# The distilled training set is regenerable from two seeds by posttrain/build_dataset.py,
# and its manifest carries the sha256 digests to verify a regenerated copy against. Eight
# megabytes of derivable JSONL does not belong in git.
posttrain/data/*.jsonl
posttrain/out/
